CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_EeveeCanEvolveIntroThreeMons::
    .string "EEVEE can evolve into one of three\n"
    .string "kinds of POKéMON.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchOffer::
    .string "I'm a geology student working with\n"
    .string "the CINNABAR LAB research team.\p"
    .string "Three pieces of my field equipment\n"
    .string "were swept out along the coast.\p"
    .string "I need the SAMPLE CASE, FIELD\n"
    .string "NOTEBOOK, and GEOLOGY KIT back.\p"
    .string "They're all beyond the shoreline, so\n"
    .string "you'll need SURF to reach them.\p"
    .string "Would you recover them for me?$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchAccepted::
    .string "Thank you!\p"
    .string "The SAMPLE CASE drifted toward a\n"
    .string "small offshore rock.\p"
    .string "The FIELD NOTEBOOK washed into a\n"
    .string "narrow inlet.\p"
    .string "The GEOLOGY KIT was last seen near\n"
    .string "an offshore rock cluster.\p"
    .string "Please bring all three back.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchNeedsSurf::
    .string "I'm preparing a coastal geology\n"
    .string "survey, but the sites are offshore.\p"
    .string "Come back once you can use SURF.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchDecline::
    .string "All right. I'll keep trying to map\n"
    .string "where the equipment washed up.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchActive::
    .string "I'm still missing the SAMPLE CASE,\n"
    .string "FIELD NOTEBOOK, and GEOLOGY KIT.\p"
    .string "They're scattered around CINNABAR's\n"
    .string "offshore rocks and inlets.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_FieldResearchReadyToReturn::
    .string "You found all three pieces!\p"
    .string "Give me a moment to sort the field\n"
    .string "samples and your reward.$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_LegendaryBirdEmail::
    .string "There's an e-mail message.\p"
    .string "… … …\p"
    .string "There are three legendary bird\n"
    .string "POKéMON.\p"
    .string "They are ARTICUNO, ZAPDOS, and\n"
    .string "MOLTRES.\p"
    .string "Their whereabouts are unknown.\p"
    .string "We plan to explore the cavern\n"
    .string "close to CERULEAN.\p"
    .string "From: POKéMON RESEARCH TEAM…$"

CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_ResearchRoom_Text_AnAmberPipe::
    .string "An amber pipe!$"

